00:17:08,646 --> 00:17:09,547
[SPEAKER_01]: I forgot what it was.

226
00:17:09,847 --> 00:17:11,168
[SPEAKER_01]: And there were a few scattered books.

227
00:17:11,655 --> 00:17:15,656
[SPEAKER_01]: And she went right away to get one of the books out to check up on Wolfgang.

228
00:17:16,177 --> 00:17:20,858
