229
00:17:20,918 --> 00:17:22,199
[SPEAKER_01]: I said, I never heard of him.

230
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:25,600
[SPEAKER_01]: And she looked him up, and yes, there was some guy named Wolfgang.

231
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:27,741
