232
00:17:28,561 --> 00:17:28,961
[SPEAKER_02]: It wasn't.

233
00:17:29,261 --> 00:17:30,102
[SPEAKER_01]: He was a ballplayer.

234
00:17:30,122 --> 00:17:36,464
[SPEAKER_01]: He pitched in about four years, and then he must have been around the time of World War I, running around 40 or 50 games.

235
00:17:36,544 --> 00:17:38,225
[SPEAKER_01]: I just couldn't remember.

236
00:17:38,265 --> 00:17:39,245
[SPEAKER_01]: I got my type of view here.

237
00:17:40,518 --> 00:17:41,438
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, here it is.

238
00:17:41,478 --> 00:17:42,218
[SPEAKER_01]: I'm going to check on him.

239
00:17:42,579 --> 00:17:44,379
