240
00:17:44,459 --> 00:17:45,399
[SPEAKER_01]: He's Wolfgang, wasn't he?

241
00:17:45,759 --> 00:17:49,360
[SPEAKER_01]: Because he's in one of the pictures I took that may come out.

242
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:50,780
