00:18:07,964 --> 00:18:08,285
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

248
00:18:09,045 --> 00:18:10,185
[SPEAKER_01]: I may have them, one or two.

249
00:18:12,666 --> 00:18:19,611
[SPEAKER_01]: But one thing he said was that Bill Clem was the umpire on that disputed play at first, which lost to Miss Purdy again, of course.

250
00:18:19,791 --> 00:18:23,414
[SPEAKER_01]: Clem never umpired the American League.

251
00:18:23,794 --> 00:18:31,399
[SPEAKER_01]: She was saying, well, Fabe, as she calls him, remembers some things one day, and then the next day remembers something else, and doesn't remember what he remembered the day before.

