254
00:18:43,218 --> 00:18:50,848
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the kind of error that he would make without any thought, and there couldn't be much about it.

255
00:18:52,450 --> 00:18:55,153
[SPEAKER_02]: So I'm going to look up those things and send them to him.

256
00:18:58,097 --> 00:19:00,580
[SPEAKER_01]: Although the interview wasn't that long, really, I did...

