00:19:00,956 --> 00:19:02,777
[SPEAKER_01]: didn't leave the place until almost quarter of one.

258
00:19:02,797 --> 00:19:07,000
[SPEAKER_01]: We talked and chatted and looked at pictures and said goodbye.

259
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:15,425
[SPEAKER_01]: She took me into another room there and showed me his collection of autographed baseballs, some fine autographed balls.

260
00:19:15,485 --> 00:19:22,809
[SPEAKER_01]: I think I took some pictures of the wall in the back study or lounge or living room in the back where we talked.

261
00:19:23,409 --> 00:19:25,090
[SPEAKER_01]: He's got a lot of his trophies there.

262
00:19:26,231 --> 00:19:29,113
[SPEAKER_01]: I took a photograph of some of the trophies on the wall.

263
00:19:33,798 --> 00:19:35,759
