[SPEAKER_01]: I took a picture of the two of them together.

265
00:19:39,481 --> 00:19:58,548
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, so I got out of there about quarter to one, one o'clock, and headed towards, well, I went back to 111th and over to 57, the interstate 57, and got, went back into town and got off at

