00:20:05,870 --> 00:20:08,631
[SPEAKER_01]: It's Marquette Street, is where it is, Marquette.

268
00:20:09,612 --> 00:20:13,074
[SPEAKER_01]: And I went over to Western Avenue to Tony Pyatt's Auto Sales.

269
00:20:14,614 --> 00:20:17,796
