[SPEAKER_01]: He says, who's calling, please?

286
00:21:05,305 --> 00:21:06,866
[SPEAKER_01]: And I said, Eugene Murnach, who are you?

287
00:21:08,406 --> 00:21:09,466
[SPEAKER_01]: So we went on for a while.

288
00:21:09,486 --> 00:21:13,447
[SPEAKER_01]: Finally, Georgiana came out, and I explained carefully what I had in mind.

289
00:21:13,467 --> 00:21:15,928
[SPEAKER_01]: And she went back for about 10 or 15 more minutes.

290
00:21:15,968 --> 00:21:17,068
[SPEAKER_01]: And suddenly, she came out and said,

291
00:21:17,648 --> 00:21:19,910
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, come on in and see if maybe we can set something up.

292
00:21:19,930 --> 00:21:26,536
[SPEAKER_01]: So I went way back into the remote corners and went into the executive office and there was Tony Pyatt, pacemaker and all.

293
00:21:27,717 --> 00:21:28,918
