[SPEAKER_01]: He didn't know a thing about business when he quit baseball in 1938 when he was 31.

301
00:21:48,569 --> 00:21:50,930
[SPEAKER_01]: And he's developed this into a million-dollar business.

302
00:21:51,250 --> 00:21:54,131
