[SPEAKER_01]: Well, he was very nice.

305
00:21:58,773 --> 00:22:06,796
[SPEAKER_01]: I must have been there about half an hour, talking generally and then setting up a meeting, which we're going to have on Wednesday, the day after tomorrow, about 11 o'clock.

