434
00:29:16,813 --> 00:29:18,674
[SPEAKER_02]: I think they did.

435
00:29:19,634 --> 00:29:21,855
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, no, they didn't let me go.

436
00:29:22,355 --> 00:29:24,576
[SPEAKER_00]: And I never even pitched any.

437
00:29:27,077 --> 00:29:29,578
[SPEAKER_02]: But they were sorry.

438
00:29:34,201 --> 00:29:41,366
