469
00:31:15,530 --> 00:31:15,950
[SPEAKER_02]: I see.

470
00:31:17,951 --> 00:31:22,152
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, you'd mix them up, and they wouldn't know when it was coming, huh?

471
00:31:22,212 --> 00:31:23,552
[SPEAKER_02]: No, no, that shouldn't count.

472
00:31:24,165 --> 00:31:25,906
[SPEAKER_00]: because I'd go to my mouth every time.

473
00:31:25,966 --> 00:31:26,326
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, is that?

474
00:31:26,466 --> 00:31:26,886
[SPEAKER_02]: I see.

475
00:31:26,986 --> 00:31:28,626
[SPEAKER_02]: Uh-huh.

476
00:31:28,666 --> 00:31:29,887
[SPEAKER_01]: I didn't know when it was coming.

477
00:31:31,227 --> 00:31:33,248
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you put much saliva on the ball?

478
00:31:33,448 --> 00:31:38,729
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, I put enough on so as to slip off, you know.

479
00:31:38,769 --> 00:31:40,630
