00:32:31,355 --> 00:32:32,095
[SPEAKER_02]: In the White Sox?

497
00:32:32,875 --> 00:32:38,217
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, there, a couple years, I had to go in the damn Navy, you know.

498
00:32:38,297 --> 00:32:39,797
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, I was gonna ask about that.

499
00:32:40,737 --> 00:32:43,298
[SPEAKER_02]: In 1918, you... Yeah.

