00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:53,421
[SPEAKER_02]: So, you must have gone early into the...

504
00:32:54,004 --> 00:32:57,445
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, I did go early, putting the whole season down there.

505
00:32:57,665 --> 00:32:58,345
[SPEAKER_00]: Where did you go?

506
00:32:58,825 --> 00:33:03,027
