00:33:19,832 --> 00:33:20,732
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, yeah, I knew him.

513
00:33:21,112 --> 00:33:22,573
[SPEAKER_02]: How'd you like Charlie Comiskey?

514
00:33:24,028 --> 00:33:26,089
[SPEAKER_02]: He was all right, as far as I knew.

515
00:33:26,830 --> 00:33:29,211
[SPEAKER_02]: I made a trip around the world with him.

516
00:33:29,231 --> 00:33:30,512
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, was that right, the 1913?

517
00:33:30,912 --> 00:33:31,953
[SPEAKER_02]: 1914, yeah.

518
00:33:33,293 --> 00:33:36,595
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you ever have any contract disputes with Comiskey?

519
00:33:36,635 --> 00:33:36,856
[SPEAKER_02]: Huh?

520
00:33:37,256 --> 00:33:39,097
