00:33:41,058 --> 00:33:43,419
[SPEAKER_02]: He had a reputation of not paying his players too much.

523
00:33:43,439 --> 00:33:44,760
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, he didn't pay too much.

524
00:33:47,362 --> 00:33:50,684
