00:37:09,012 --> 00:37:10,673
[SPEAKER_02]: Jackson was one in particular.

582
00:37:10,793 --> 00:37:11,053
[SPEAKER_02]: Who?

583
00:37:11,433 --> 00:37:12,153
[SPEAKER_02]: Joe Jackson.

